meta {
  name: Reviews
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Reviews of {{restaurant}}'s first dish (firstDishId, set by List dishes).
  One review per user per dish: PUT …/reviews/me creates (201) or replaces
  (200) yours. Text is scored for sentiment when it's written.

  Until login exists (Round 4), the X-Demo-User header names the reviewer.
  It is not authentication.
}
